<div class="ga-shipping-page-wrapper" style="padding: 2rem 0; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-sans);">
  
  <!-- Editorial Page Header -->
  <div class="ga-shipping-header-editorial" style="text-align: center; max-width: 800px; margin: 4rem auto 5rem auto; border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--ga-border-color); padding-bottom: 3.5rem; padding-left: 1.5rem; padding-right: 1.5rem;">
    <span class="ga-subtitle" style="color: var(--ga-gold-cream); font-size: 1.3rem; letter-spacing: 0.3em; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;">Ghar Jaisa Shuddh • Parampara Jaisa Anmol</span>
    <h1 class="ga-title" style="font-size: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 4.4rem); font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif); margin-top: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--ga-forest-green);">Refund, Return &amp; Customer Support Policy</h1>
    <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto 1.5rem auto;">
      At Ghar Aangan, we are building a young Indian food brand rooted in the purity, warmth, and traditions of the Pahad. Every order matters to us. This policy explains how we process, ship, deliver, and resolve issues with your order so that you know what to expect.
    </p>
    <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 1.5rem; font-size: 1.4rem; color: var(--ga-forest-green); font-weight: 500;">
      <span>📞 Support: <strong>+91 90272 48335</strong></span>
      <span>👤 Owner (Manisha Lohani): <strong>+91 72920 02260</strong></span>
      <span>✉️ <strong>gharaanganmani@gmail.com</strong></span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Main Text-Based Policy Content -->
  <div class="ga-shipping-content-block" style="max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto 6rem auto; padding: 0 1.5rem;">
    
    <!-- Section 1 -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;" class="ga-reveal">
      <h2 class="ga-title" style="font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif); color: var(--ga-forest-green);">1. Food Safety &amp; Return Nature</h2>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 1.2rem;">
        Ghar Aangan provides pure, artisanal food and dairy products prepared with traditional methods. To maintain strict health, safety, and hygiene standards, <strong>we do not accept physical returns or exchanges of opened, seal-broken, or consumed products</strong>.
      </p>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300;">
        Ghar Aangan aims to resolve genuine complaints fairly. Refunds or replacements are considered based on the nature of the issue, evidence provided, product condition, and circumstances of the order. Customers should contact us as soon as possible after delivery when there is a problem.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 2 -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;" class="ga-reveal">
      <h2 class="ga-title" style="font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif); color: var(--ga-forest-green);">2. Packaging: Glass &amp; Steel</h2>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300;">
        Our <strong>550 ml, 1 litre, and 2 litre</strong> ghee products are packed in premium food-grade glass jars to preserve taste and aroma. Our <strong>5 litre</strong> ghee product is packed in a traditional <strong>steel Dolchi</strong>. Glass is delicate, so we use protective packaging and take reasonable care while preparing every shipment. However, courier handling is outside our direct control.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 3 -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;" class="ga-reveal">
      <h2 class="ga-title" style="font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif); color: var(--ga-forest-green);">3. Damaged Glass on Delivery</h2>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 1.2rem;">
        If a glass jar arrives cracked or broken, <strong>do not consume the product</strong>. Contact us immediately and share clear photographs/video of the outer package, shipping label, and damaged product. We will investigate with the courier and work toward an applicable replacement or refund.
      </p>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300;">
        <em>Note: Damage claims should be raised immediately upon delivery. Damage caused by dropping or mishandling the product after delivery is not treated as transit damage.</em>
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 4 -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;" class="ga-reveal">
      <h2 class="ga-title" style="font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif); color: var(--ga-forest-green);">4. Damaged, Leaking or Tampered Shipments</h2>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300;">
        If a package appears severely damaged, leaking, or tampered with at delivery, document the condition with photographs/video before opening or consuming it wherever reasonably possible. Contact us promptly with your order number and evidence so we can investigate and, where appropriate, raise a courier claim.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 5 -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;" class="ga-reveal">
      <h2 class="ga-title" style="font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif); color: var(--ga-forest-green);">5. Product Quality Complaints &amp; Expired Products</h2>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 1.2rem;">
        <strong>Quality Concerns:</strong> If a customer believes the ghee has an unusual smell, unacceptable taste, or another genuine quality issue, contact us promptly. We may request photographs, videos, batch details, packaging information, or other reasonable evidence. Depending on the circumstances and our assessment, a replacement or refund may be provided.
      </p>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300;">
        <strong>Expired Products:</strong> If an expired product is delivered, contact us immediately with photographs showing the product, batch information, and expiry/best-before date. After verification, we will provide an appropriate resolution, which ordinarily includes a full refund or replacement.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 6 -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;" class="ga-reveal">
      <h2 class="ga-title" style="font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif); color: var(--ga-forest-green);">6. Lost Shipments</h2>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300;">
        If a shipment is lost in transit, Ghar Aangan will follow up with the relevant logistics partner. The final resolution can depend on the courier investigation and claim process. Where the courier provides a resolution or compensation, we will communicate it to the customer. Where the courier does not provide a full resolution, <strong>Ghar Aangan may provide a 50% refund of the affected product value</strong>, subject to investigation and the circumstances of the case.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 7 -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;" class="ga-reveal">
      <h2 class="ga-title" style="font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif); color: var(--ga-forest-green);">7. Refund Settlements &amp; Timelines</h2>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        Once a refund is approved by our support desk:
      </p>
      <ul style="list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; margin-top: 1rem; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-sans); font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--ga-dark-text);">
        <li style="margin-bottom: 1rem; padding-left: 2rem; position: relative;">
          <span style="position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--ga-gold-cream);">✦</span>
          <strong>Prepaid Orders:</strong> The refund is credited directly back to your original payment method (Credit/Debit Card, Netbanking, or UPI wallet). This transaction normally reflects within <strong>5 to 7 business days</strong> depending on your bank provider.
        </li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 1rem; padding-left: 2rem; position: relative;">
          <span style="position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--ga-gold-cream);">✦</span>
          <strong>Cash on Delivery (COD):</strong> For eligible COD order returns or replacements, approved refunds are settled via direct bank transfer (NEFT) or UPI upon customer verification within <strong>5 to 7 business days</strong>.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 8 -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;" class="ga-reveal">
      <h2 class="ga-title" style="font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif); color: var(--ga-forest-green);">8. When Refunds May Not Apply</h2>
      <ul style="list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-sans); font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--ga-dark-text);">
        <li style="margin-bottom: 1rem; padding-left: 2rem; position: relative;">
          <span style="position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--ga-gold-cream);">✦</span>
          Refunds are generally not available merely because a customer changes their mind after dispatch.
        </li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 1rem; padding-left: 2rem; position: relative;">
          <span style="position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--ga-gold-cream);">✦</span>
          Refunds may not be available where a food product has been opened, consumed, or tasted and the complaint is only a matter of subjective personal taste preference, unless there is a genuine quality/safety defect.
        </li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 1rem; padding-left: 2rem; position: relative;">
          <span style="position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--ga-gold-cream);">✦</span>
          <strong>Food Handling After Delivery:</strong> Customers should follow storage instructions on packaging. Once safely delivered, Ghar Aangan cannot be responsible for deterioration caused by improper storage, moisture contamination, mishandling, or accidental dropping.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 9 -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;" class="ga-reveal">
      <h2 class="ga-title" style="font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif); color: var(--ga-forest-green);">9. GST &amp; Taxes</h2>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300;">
        For applicable Ghar Aangan food and dairy products, GST is charged according to Indian tax rules and the product's correct classification/HSN (5% rate where applicable). Intra-state supplies involve CGST + SGST/UTGST, while inter-state supplies involve IGST.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- FAQ Section (Single Column Text Layout) -->
  <div style="max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto 6rem auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; border-top: 1.5px solid var(--ga-border-color); padding-top: 5rem;">
    <h2 class="ga-title" style="font-size: 2.4rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; text-align: left; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif); color: var(--ga-forest-green);">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

    <style>
      .ga-faq-details {
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ga-border-color);
        padding: 2.2rem 0;
        cursor: pointer;
      }
      .ga-faq-summary {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        list-style: none;
        outline: none;
        font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif);
        font-size: 1.85rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--ga-forest-green);
      }
      .ga-faq-summary::-webkit-details-marker {
        display: none;
      }
      .ga-faq-icon {
        font-size: 1.8rem;
        color: var(--ga-gold-cream);
        transition: transform 0.4s ease;
      }
      .ga-faq-details[open] .ga-faq-icon {
        transform: rotate(45deg);
      }
      .ga-faq-content {
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
        padding-right: 2rem;
      }
    </style>

    <div class="ga-faq-container">
      
      <!-- FAQ 1 -->
      <details class="ga-faq-details">
        <summary class="ga-faq-summary">
          <span>Can I get a refund if I do not like the taste or aroma?</span>
          <span class="ga-faq-icon">✦</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="ga-faq-content">
          <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.65; font-weight: 300; margin: 0; color: var(--ga-dark-text);">
            Our A2 Ghee is prepared using traditional wood-fired Bilona churning in earthen pots. This authentic process creates a natural smoky aroma and rich granular (danedaar) texture that differs from factory-produced ghee. Because taste and aroma are subjective preferences, refunds are not available merely for personal flavor choices unless there is a genuine verified quality issue.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 2 -->
      <details class="ga-faq-details">
        <summary class="ga-faq-summary">
          <span>Do I need to return broken glass jars?</span>
          <span class="ga-faq-icon">✦</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="ga-faq-content">
          <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.65; font-weight: 300; margin: 0; color: var(--ga-dark-text);">
            No. For your safety, do not handle or mail broken glass back to us. Simply send clear photos and videos of the outer package, shipping label, and broken jar to our support team upon delivery, and we will initiate the replacement.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 3 -->
      <details class="ga-faq-details">
        <summary class="ga-faq-summary">
          <span>What happens if my package is lost in transit?</span>
          <span class="ga-faq-icon">✦</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="ga-faq-content">
          <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.65; font-weight: 300; margin: 0; color: var(--ga-dark-text);">
            If a courier loses a shipment in transit, we follow up directly with the logistics partner. If the courier fails to provide a full resolution, Ghar Aangan may provide a 50% refund of the affected product value, subject to investigation.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 4 -->
      <details class="ga-faq-details">
        <summary class="ga-faq-summary">
          <span>Is Cash on Delivery (COD) available?</span>
          <span class="ga-faq-icon">✦</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="ga-faq-content">
          <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.65; font-weight: 300; margin: 0; color: var(--ga-dark-text);">
            Yes, Cash on Delivery (COD) is available across India with a ₹100 handling fee. Prepaid orders (UPI, Cards, Netbanking) enjoy Free Express Shipping under our promotional offers.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

    </div>
  </div>

