      <h2 class="ga-title ga-text-white" style="color: #ffffff; font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif);">We Are Here To Support You</h2>
      <p class="ga-body" style="color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9); font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
        We are a growing brand and genuinely value every customer. If something goes wrong with your order, please contact us before assuming that it cannot be resolved. We will make reasonable efforts to investigate genuine concerns and coordinate with our logistics partners.
